    "ls|LS17_S8_U_64": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF RAILWAYS \n \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.64 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 02.02.2022 \n \nFREQUENCY OF TRAIN \n \n†64. SHRI DEEPAK BAIJ:  \n \n \n Will the Minister of RAILWAYS be pleased to state: \n \n(a) the  number of days on which the Visakhapatnam -Kirandul Night \nExpress (18513/18514) under the East Coast Railways was being \noperated before corona pandemic; \n \n(b) the number of days in a week the said train is being operated at \npresent; and \n \n(c) whether  there is a continuous demand by the public \nrepresentatives and passengers to operate this train entire week as it \nwas earlier? \n \n \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF RAILWAYS, COMMUNICATIONS AND ELECTRONICS & \nINFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \n \n(SHRI ASHWINI VAISHNAW) \n \n \n(a) Prior to discontinuation of all regular passenger carrying train \nservices w.e.f. 23.03.2020, 18513/14 Visakhaptanam -Kirandul Express \nwas being operated as a daily service.  \n \n(b) At present, 18513/14 Visakhaptanam -Kirandul Express is being \noperated as a bi-weekly service. \n \n (c) Yes, Sir. Representations, including from the Hon’ble Member of \nParliament, have been received for running this train as a daily \nservice. \n***** ",
